  "schema": "bd-mutate-spec/1",
  "_comment": "Row 261. Re-run with toolchain/bin/bd-mutate --spec tests/mutants/row261_replication_lifecycle_identity.json --work DETACHED_SCRATCH. The real-process gate forces lock contention and the unit paths prove duplicate-start refusal, legacy PID non-authority, pidfd delivery, and post-pidfd start-identity verification.",
  "subject": "replication start and stop are serialized and signal only the launched process identity",
